es/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:48:- Story Gate: cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify — pass (33 files / 309 tests)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:49:- Completion Gate: pnpm run verify-all — pass (33 files / 309 tests; identical to verify now that process suites are deleted)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:61:  - artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/006-verify.json (pass, zero findings, codex/gpt-5.5)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:62:- Story Gate: cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify — pass (327 tests)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:63:- Completion Gate: pnpm run verify-all — pass (327 tests)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:76:  - artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/005-verify.json (pass; SV-03-001 fixed; convergence inside story-lead loop)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:77:- Story Gate: cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify — pass (353 tests)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:78:- Completion Gate: pnpm run verify-all — pass (37 files / 353 tests)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:91:  - artifacts/04-failure-classification/004-verify.json (pass, zero findings, codex/gpt-5.5)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:92:- Story Gate: cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify — pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:93:- Completion Gate: pnpm run verify-all — pass (38 files / 365 tests)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md:115:- Story 5 BLOCKED awaiting LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY from user: implementation complete (openrouter-call.ts fixture, inference-real.test.ts, lifecycle capstone parameterization), unkeyed accounting legs pass, but DoD-required keye