specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:50:- **TC-4.1** (AC-4.1): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:54:  - the not-ran record is distinguishable from a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:56:- **TC-4.2** (AC-4.2): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:64:- **TC-4.3** (AC-1.2, AC-4.1): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:83:- The not-ran path is as important as the keyed path because silent pass is the failure mode.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:109:- [test-plan.md §TC-4.1 / TC-4.2 / TC-4.3](/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/test-plan.md:91), lines 91-104\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:117:| TC-4.1 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | keyed seven-kind real round-trips; unkeyed not-ran record; exactly one suite-level ran/not-ran output line |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:118:| TC-4.2 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | Epic 04 lifecycle sequence under real adapter with structural checkpoint assertions |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:119:| TC-4.3 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | OpenRouter host passes shared `ModelCall` contract and SDK routing helpers |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:121:#### Architecture-Risk Tests\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:125:| Silent real-suite skip | `test/inference-real.test.ts` unkeyed guard leg | Not-ran record has reason and cannot look like pass | A skipped keyed suite could leave default CI green without proving anything |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:126:| Fixture does not represent host boundary | `test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts` helpers | Same contract/routing helpers run against fake and real host functions | A direct OpenRouter call could pass while violating the SDK boundary shape |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:170:The CI-default suite makes zero network calls. The keyed run is recorded in story completion notes with date, model, and pass state.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:181:- Do not hide missing key with test skip semantics indistinguishable from pass.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:205:- Suite guard emits exactly one visible ran/not-ran record and unkeyed absence cannot look like a pass.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:206:- Keyed seven-kind real round-trip passes with non-empty, non-marker ready forms and real-model provenance.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:207:- Real-adapter lifecycle capstone passes structural checkpoint assertions.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:208:- TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 are green in the keyed local run; unkeyed not-ran accounting is green in default CI.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:209:- Story completion notes record keyed run date, model, and pass state.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:232:| `test/inference-real.test.ts` | opt-in (`LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY`) | TC-4.1, TC-4.2, TC-4.3 |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:245:- `hangingCall()` → `ModelCall` that never settles (timeout leg; tests pass a small `timeoutMs`).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:252:**`test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts`** (Chunk 0) — the parameterized contract assertions (DD-13): `assertModelCallContract(call)` (shape of success/failure results on a probe call) and `assertRoutingThroughSdk(call, assignments)` (TC-1.2's routing assertions extracted so TC-4.3 runs them against the real host unchanged).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:292:- exhaustion leg: all-whitespace script → form `failed`, reason `provider_failure`, last error names `empty_output`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:298:- `auth` → `failed` first attempt; scripted call shows exactly one invocation; stable reason\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:299:- `network` to exhaustion → `failed`, `provider_failure`, `metadata.lastError` preserved\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:307:### TC-4.1 — Real round-trips + accounting (AC-4.1)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:310:- unkeyed (controlled: suite re-invoked with key stripped from env in a subprocess-free way — the guard function called directly with empty env) → `notRan` record with reason; assert the record's shape and that it is not a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:313:### TC-4.2 — Capstone (AC-4.2)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:318:### TC-4.3 — Contract conformance, both hosts (AC-1.2, AC-4.1)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:363:| construction tests passing `floorTokens` | updated to two-field budgets; one new test: passing `floorTokens` is rejected as unknown config | config surface change |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:370:House pattern: Red = failing tests + skeleton stubs returning structured not-implemented failures; `red-verify` (build, typecheck, lint, boundaries — no behavior tests); Green = implementation until the chunk's tests pass; immutability check on test files after Green.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:379:| 5: Real suite | `inference-real` (guard testable unkeyed) | OpenRouter fixture, accounting guard, capstone leg | unkeyed: not-ran record asserted in CI; keyed: TC-4.1–4.3 green locally (run recorded in story DoD with model used) |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:382:**Story-completion accounting for Chunk 5:** the keyed run cannot gate CI (no secret in CI by design). The story's DoD requires a recorded keyed run — date, model, pass state — in the deviation/completion notes. A keyed run that has never happened blocks epic acceptance: the capstone is the integration-readiness gate, and an unexercised gate is the silent-skip failure mode this suite exists to prevent.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:384:## Architecture-Risk Tests\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:392:| Silent real-suite skip | TC-4.1's unkeyed leg asserts the not-ran record exists and is not a pass |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:436:    planSummary: \"Implemented Chunk 5 (Story 5: Real-Inference Suite and Capstone). Added the test-owned OpenRouter ModelCall host (test/fixtures/openrouter-call.ts) implementing the AC-1.2 contract over plain fetch with the story's HTTP-status→failure-kind mapping (401/403→auth, 429→rate_limit, 400→invalid_request, network→network, other→other), resolveRealSuiteEnv key/model resolution (LHC_OPENROUTER_MODEL optional, fixture default openai/gpt-4o-mini), and a suite-level accounting emitter that writes exactly one visible RAN/NOT-RAN line. Parameterized the Epic 04 lifecycle fixture with an optional InferenceConfig so the capstone replays the identical sequence with the real adapter in the provider-arrival slot. Wrote test/inference-real.test.ts: four always-run accounting tests (unkeyed not-ran record with reason, shape distinguishable from a pass, whitespace-key leg, model defaulting, exactly-one-emission assertion) plus key-gated legs — TC-4.3 runs the unchanged assertModelCallContract/assertRoutingThroughSdk seam-conformance helpers against the real host, TC-4.1 asserts all seven kinds land ready with non-empty non-marker content and config-stamped openrouter provenance, TC-4.2 runs the full Epic 04 lifecycle (intake→drain→compact→pull→inspect→edit→rebuild→drain→compact→materialize) asserting every kind ready ≥ once, no deterministic marker anywhere (forms, both pulls, materialized file), real-model provenance, cleared-then-ready regeneration with content different from the pre-edit snapshot, checkpoint-coherent health (settled / cleared-set-pending-unclaimed / settled), and post-edit content in the second compact's view. CI default makes zero network calls; keyed legs report as skipped (never passes) with one NOT-RAN line. No package.json change needed: Story 1's verify rewrite already runs the env-gated suite in the default vitest tier.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:446:        reason: \"createLifecycleSdk/runLifecycle gain an optional InferenceConfig so the TC-4.2 capstone replays the exact Epic 04 sequence with the real adapter; deterministic default unchanged\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:449:        reason: \"New opt-in real-inference suite: TC-4.1 accounting + seven real round-trips, TC-4.2 lifecycle capstone structural assertions, TC-4.3 shared seam-conformance against the real host\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:465:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:468:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:471:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:473:      passesRun: 0\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:479:        - \"TC-4.2's regeneration assertion (post-rebuild content !== pre-edit content) is probabilistic against a real model in principle, but mutation-cleared forms re-derive from changed inputs, so collision is implausible; it is the spec's own assertion\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:482:      - \"DoD item 'keyed seven-kind real round-trip / capstone green in keyed local run, recorded with date, model, pass state' cannot be completed in this environment: LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY is not set and no key exists in the repo or shell profile. A human must run `cd packages/lhc && LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY=<key> pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts` once and record date, model (default openai/gpt-4o-mini unless LHC_OPENROUTER_MODEL set), and pass state in the story completion notes. Per the test plan this blocks epic acceptance, not the unkeyed story gate, which is green.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:484:      - \"Implementation target 'Verify accounting: packages/lhc/package.json scripts' required no change — Story 1's verify/verify-all rewrite already runs the env-gated suite inside the default vitest tier, and the suite self-reports its one ran/not-ran line there (observed in gate output: 'NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)').\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:485:    recommendedNextStep: \"Run story verification; in parallel, have the operator perform the one keyed local run with LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY and record date/model/pass-state in the completion notes to satisfy the remaining DoD line before epic acceptance.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:664:Outcome: failed\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:691:{\"action\":\"run-self-review\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"artifactRefs\":[\"/abs/path.json\"],\"focus\":\"optional\",\"continuationRef\":\"storyImplementor\",\"passes\":1}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:696:{\"action\":\"accept-story\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"summary\":\"...\",\"acceptanceCheckRefs\":[\"...\"],\"acceptanceChecks\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"],\"reasoning\":\"...\"}],\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"accept\"},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"pass\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"...\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"]}]}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:712:Choose `accept-story` only when the latest verifier result is `pass`, no open findings remain, required proof is present, and the configured story gate passed.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:713:If readiness is promising but gate truth is failed, unavailable, or uncertain, do not accept. Choose the smallest safe next action: verify, quick-fix, block, or request a ruling.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:7:Do not invent tools, bypass the bounded action protocol, or rely on hidden provider session memory.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:45:- **AC-4.1**: The real-inference suite is opt-in on key presence and its outcome is always visible: ran (with the model assignments used) or not-ran (with reason) in the suite output. Absence of the key can never produce a silent pass. The suite's model-call function lives in test code, implements the AC-1.2 contract, and reaches a real endpoint.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:50:- **TC-4.1** (AC-4.1): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:54:  - the not-ran record is distinguishable from a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:56:- **TC-4.2** (AC-4.2): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:64:- **TC-4.3** (AC-1.2, AC-4.1): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:83:- The not-ran path is as important as the keyed path because silent pass is the failure mode.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:109:- [test-plan.md §TC-4.1 / TC-4.2 / TC-4.3](/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/test-plan.md:91), lines 91-104\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:117:| TC-4.1 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | keyed seven-kind real round-trips; unkeyed not-ran record; exactly one suite-level ran/not-ran output line |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:118:| TC-4.2 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | Epic 04 lifecycle sequence under real adapter with structural checkpoint assertions |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:119:| TC-4.3 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | OpenRouter host passes shared `ModelCall` contract and SDK routing helpers |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:121:#### Architecture-Risk Tests\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:125:| Silent real-suite skip | `test/inference-real.test.ts` unkeyed guard leg | Not-ran record has reason and cannot look like pass | A skipped keyed suite could leave default CI green without proving anything |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:126:| Fixture does not represent host boundary | `test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts` helpers | Same contract/routing helpers run against fake and real host functions | A direct OpenRouter call could pass while violating the SDK boundary shape |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:170:The CI-default suite makes zero network calls. The keyed run is recorded in story completion notes with date, model, and pass state.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:181:- Do not hide missing key with test skip semantics indistinguishable from pass.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:205:- Suite guard emits exactly one visible ran/not-ran record and unkeyed absence cannot look like a pass.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:206:- Keyed seven-kind real round-trip passes with non-empty, non-marker ready forms and real-model provenance.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:207:- Real-adapter lifecycle capstone passes structural checkpoint assertions.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:208:- TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 are green in the keyed local run; unkeyed not-ran accounting is green in default CI.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:209:- Story completion notes record keyed run date, model, and pass state.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:232:| `test/inference-real.test.ts` | opt-in (`LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY`) | TC-4.1, TC-4.2, TC-4.3 |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:245:- `hangingCall()` → `ModelCall` that never settles (timeout leg; tests pass a small `timeoutMs`).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:252:**`test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts`** (Chunk 0) — the parameterized contract assertions (DD-13): `assertModelCallContract(call)` (shape of success/failure results on a probe call) and `assertRoutingThroughSdk(call, assignments)` (TC-1.2's routing assertions extracted so TC-4.3 runs them against the real host unchanged).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:292:- exhaustion leg: all-whitespace script → form `failed`, reason `provider_failure`, last error names `empty_output`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:298:- `auth` → `failed` first attempt; scripted call shows exactly one invocation; stable reason\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:299:- `network` to exhaustion → `failed`, `provider_failure`, `metadata.lastError` preserved\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:307:### TC-4.1 — Real round-trips + accounting (AC-4.1)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:310:- unkeyed (controlled: suite re-invoked with key stripped from env in a subprocess-free way — the guard function called directly with empty env) → `notRan` record with reason; assert the record's shape and that it is not a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:313:### TC-4.2 — Capstone (AC-4.2)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:318:### TC-4.3 — Contract conformance, both hosts (AC-1.2, AC-4.1)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:363:| construction tests passing `floorTokens` | updated to two-field budgets; one new test: passing `floorTokens` is rejected as unknown config | config surface change |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:370:House pattern: Red = failing tests + skeleton stubs returning structured not-implemented failures; `red-verify` (build, typecheck, lint, boundaries — no behavior tests); Green = implementation until the chunk's tests pass; immutability check on test files after Green.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:379:| 5: Real suite | `inference-real` (guard testable unkeyed) | OpenRouter fixture, accounting guard, capstone leg | unkeyed: not-ran record asserted in CI; keyed: TC-4.1–4.3 green locally (run recorded in story DoD with model used) |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:382:**Story-completion accounting for Chunk 5:** the keyed run cannot gate CI (no secret in CI by design). The story's DoD requires a recorded keyed run — date, model, pass state — in the deviation/completion notes. A keyed run that has never happened blocks epic acceptance: the capstone is the integration-readiness gate, and an unexercised gate is the silent-skip failure mode this suite exists to prevent.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:384:## Architecture-Risk Tests\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:392:| Silent real-suite skip | TC-4.1's unkeyed leg asserts the not-ran record exists and is not a pass |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:409:- latest_self_note: \"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:457:    reviewScopeSummary: \"Initial verification for Story 5 covered AC-4.1, AC-4.2, TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3. I inspected the OpenRouter test host, suite accounting guard, keyed test wiring, shared seam helpers, lifecycle capstone wiring, package scripts, and relevant production inference paths; I ran the configured story and epic gates plus the focused unkeyed real-suite test.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:465:        evidence: \"The required keyed evidence was not established: the local environment has no LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY, `pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts` printed `NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)` and reported `4 passed | 9 skipped`, so the keyed TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 legs did not execute. The implementor artifact also records that the keyed local run and completion note are absent. The story DoD requires TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 green in a keyed local run and completion notes with date, model, and pass state; test-plan.md states an unexercised keyed run blocks acceptance.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:475:          - \"TC-4.1\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:476:          - \"TC-4.2\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:477:          - \"TC-4.3\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:486:        evidence: \"The required keyed evidence was not established: the local environment has no LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY, `pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts` printed `NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)` and reported `4 passed | 9 skipped`, so the keyed TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 legs did not execute. The implementor artifact also records that the keyed local run and completion note are absent. The story DoD requires TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 green in a keyed local run and completion notes with date, model, and pass state; test-plan.md states an unexercised keyed run blocks acceptance.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:496:          - \"TC-4.1\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:497:          - \"TC-4.2\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:498:          - \"TC-4.3\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:504:        - \"TC-4.1 unkeyed accounting: resolveRealSuiteEnv returns a not-ran record for absent or blank key; emitRealSuiteAccounting records one visible line; unkeyed focused suite output showed exactly one NOT-RAN line.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:506:        - \"TC-4.2 test wiring exists: runLifecycle accepts an InferenceConfig and inference-real.test.ts wires the real adapter into the Epic 04 lifecycle sequence when keyed.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:507:        - \"TC-4.3 test wiring exists: inference-real.test.ts invokes assertModelCallContract and assertRoutingThroughSdk against createOpenRouterCall when keyed.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:511:        - \"TC-4.3 keyed real-host conformance: the shared helper legs were skipped because LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY was unset.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:512:        - \"Definition of Done: no story completion note records keyed run date, model, and pass state.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:516:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:519:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:522:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:531:      - \"Provide a keyed run receipt for `cd packages/lhc && LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY=<key> pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts`, including date, model, and pass state, then rerun verification.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:533:      - \"Default CI posture is behaving as designed: the unkeyed suite reports NOT-RAN visibly and the story/epic gates passed without a network key.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:574:    planSummary: \"Implemented Chunk 5 (Story 5: Real-Inference Suite and Capstone). Added the test-owned OpenRouter ModelCall host (test/fixtures/openrouter-call.ts) implementing the AC-1.2 contract over plain fetch with the story's HTTP-status→failure-kind mapping (401/403→auth, 429→rate_limit, 400→invalid_request, network→network, other→other), resolveRealSuiteEnv key/model resolution (LHC_OPENROUTER_MODEL optional, fixture default openai/gpt-4o-mini), and a suite-level accounting emitter that writes exactly one visible RAN/NOT-RAN line. Parameterized the Epic 04 lifecycle fixture with an optional InferenceConfig so the capstone replays the identical sequence with the real adapter in the provider-arrival slot. Wrote test/inference-real.test.ts: four always-run accounting tests (unkeyed not-ran record with reason, shape distinguishable from a pass, whitespace-key leg, model defaulting, exactly-one-emission assertion) plus key-gated legs — TC-4.3 runs the unchanged assertModelCallContract/assertRoutingThroughSdk seam-conformance helpers against the real host, TC-4.1 asserts all seven kinds land ready with non-empty non-marker content and config-stamped openrouter provenance, TC-4.2 runs the full Epic 04 lifecycle (intake→drain→compact→pull→inspect→edit→rebuild→drain→compact→materialize) asserting every kind ready ≥ once, no deterministic marker anywhere (forms, both pulls, materialized file), real-model provenance, cleared-then-ready regeneration with content different from the pre-edit snapshot, checkpoint-coherent health (settled / cleared-set-pending-unclaimed / settled), and post-edit content in the second compact's view. CI default makes zero network calls; keyed legs report as skipped (never passes) with one NOT-RAN line. No package.json change needed: Story 1's verify rewrite already runs the env-gated suite in the default vitest tier.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:584:        reason: \"createLifecycleSdk/runLifecycle gain an optional InferenceConfig so the TC-4.2 capstone replays the exact Epic 04 sequence with the real adapter; deterministic default unchanged\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:587:        reason: \"New opt-in real-inference suite: TC-4.1 accounting + seven real round-trips, TC-4.2 lifecycle capstone structural assertions, TC-4.3 shared seam-conformance against the real host\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:603:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:606:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:609:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:611:      passesRun: 0\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:617:        - \"TC-4.2's regeneration assertion (post-rebuild content !== pre-edit content) is probabilistic against a real model in principle, but mutation-cleared forms re-derive from changed inputs, so collision is implausible; it is the spec's own assertion\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:620:      - \"DoD item 'keyed seven-kind real round-trip / capstone green in keyed local run, recorded with date, model, pass state' cannot be completed in this environment: LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY is not set and no key exists in the repo or shell profile. A human must run `cd packages/lhc && LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY=<key> pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts` once and record date, model (default openai/gpt-4o-mini unless LHC_OPENROUTER_MODEL set), and pass state in the story completion notes. Per the test plan this blocks epic acceptance, not the unkeyed story gate, which is green.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:622:      - \"Implementation target 'Verify accounting: packages/lhc/package.json scripts' required no change — Story 1's verify/verify-all rewrite already runs the env-gated suite inside the default vitest tier, and the suite self-reports its one ran/not-ran line there (observed in gate output: 'NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)').\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:623:    recommendedNextStep: \"Run story verification; in parallel, have the operator perform the one keyed local run with LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY and record date/model/pass-state in the completion notes to satisfy the remaining DoD line before epic acceptance.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:683:  summary: \"Implementation is ready for verification, but acceptance requires an independent verifier pass and keyed OpenRouter proof is not present in the durable record.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:693:Latest note highlight: If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:697:- sequence=8; actionSequence=7; createdAt=2026-06-12T23:31:13.215Z; note=\"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:777:    selfNote: \"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:785:    note: \"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:854:Outcome: failed\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:881:{\"action\":\"run-self-review\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"artifactRefs\":[\"/abs/path.json\"],\"focus\":\"optional\",\"continuationRef\":\"storyImplementor\",\"passes\":1}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:886:{\"action\":\"accept-story\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"summary\":\"...\",\"acceptanceCheckRefs\":[\"...\"],\"acceptanceChecks\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"],\"reasoning\":\"...\"}],\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"accept\"},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"pass\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"...\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"]}]}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:902:Choose `accept-story` only when the latest verifier result is `pass`, no open findings remain, required proof is present, and the configured story gate passed.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:903:If readiness is promising but gate truth is failed, unavailable, or uncertain, do not accept. Choose the smallest safe next action: verify, quick-fix, block, or request a ruling.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:7:Do not invent tools, bypass the bounded action protocol, or rely on hidden provider session memory.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:45:- **AC-4.1**: The real-inference suite is opt-in on key presence and its outcome is always visible: ran (with the model assignments used) or not-ran (with reason) in the suite output. Absence of the key can never produce a silent pass. The suite's model-call function lives in test code, implements the AC-1.2 contract, and reaches a real endpoint.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:50:- **TC-4.1** (AC-4.1): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:54:  - the not-ran record is distinguishable from a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:56:- **TC-4.2** (AC-4.2): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:64:- **TC-4.3** (AC-1.2, AC-4.1): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:83:- The not-ran path is as important as the keyed path because silent pass is the failure mode.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:109:- [test-plan.md §TC-4.1 / TC-4.2 / TC-4.3](/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/test-plan.md:91), lines 91-104\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:117:| TC-4.1 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | keyed seven-kind real round-trips; unkeyed not-ran record; exactly one suite-level ran/not-ran output line |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:118:| TC-4.2 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | Epic 04 lifecycle sequence under real adapter with structural checkpoint assertions |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:119:| TC-4.3 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | OpenRouter host passes shared `ModelCall` contract and SDK routing helpers |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:121:#### Architecture-Risk Tests\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:125:| Silent real-suite skip | `test/inference-real.test.ts` unkeyed guard leg | Not-ran record has reason and cannot look like pass | A skipped keyed suite could leave default CI green without proving anything |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:126:| Fixture does not represent host boundary | `test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts` helpers | Same contract/routing helpers run against fake and real host functions | A direct OpenRouter call could pass while violating the SDK boundary shape |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:170:The CI-default suite makes zero network calls. The keyed run is recorded in story completion notes with date, model, and pass state.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:181:- Do not hide missing key with test skip semantics indistinguishable from pass.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:205:- Suite guard emits exactly one visible ran/not-ran record and unkeyed absence cannot look like a pass.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:206:- Keyed seven-kind real round-trip passes with non-empty, non-marker ready forms and real-model provenance.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:207:- Real-adapter lifecycle capstone passes structural checkpoint assertions.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:208:- TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 are green in the keyed local run; unkeyed not-ran accounting is green in default CI.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:209:- Story completion notes record keyed run date, model, and pass state.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:232:| `test/inference-real.test.ts` | opt-in (`LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY`) | TC-4.1, TC-4.2, TC-4.3 |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:245:- `hangingCall()` → `ModelCall` that never settles (timeout leg; tests pass a small `timeoutMs`).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:252:**`test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts`** (Chunk 0) — the parameterized contract assertions (DD-13): `assertModelCallContract(call)` (shape of success/failure results on a probe call) and `assertRoutingThroughSdk(call, assignments)` (TC-1.2's routing assertions extracted so TC-4.3 runs them against the real host unchanged).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:292:- exhaustion leg: all-whitespace script → form `failed`, reason `provider_failure`, last error names `empty_output`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:298:- `auth` → `failed` first attempt; scripted call shows exactly one invocation; stable reason\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:299:- `network` to exhaustion → `failed`, `provider_failure`, `metadata.lastError` preserved\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:307:### TC-4.1 — Real round-trips + accounting (AC-4.1)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:310:- unkeyed (controlled: suite re-invoked with key stripped from env in a subprocess-free way — the guard function called directly with empty env) → `notRan` record with reason; assert the record's shape and that it is not a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:313:### TC-4.2 — Capstone (AC-4.2)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:318:### TC-4.3 — Contract conformance, both hosts (AC-1.2, AC-4.1)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:363:| construction tests passing `floorTokens` | updated to two-field budgets; one new test: passing `floorTokens` is rejected as unknown config | config surface change |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:370:House pattern: Red = failing tests + skeleton stubs returning structured not-implemented failures; `red-verify` (build, typecheck, lint, boundaries — no behavior tests); Green = implementation until the chunk's tests pass; immutability check on test files after Green.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:379:| 5: Real suite | `inference-real` (guard testable unkeyed) | OpenRouter fixture, accounting guard, capstone leg | unkeyed: not-ran record asserted in CI; keyed: TC-4.1–4.3 green locally (run recorded in story DoD with model used) |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:382:**Story-completion accounting for Chunk 5:** the keyed run cannot gate CI (no secret in CI by design). The story's DoD requires a recorded keyed run — date, model, pass state — in the deviation/completion notes. A keyed run that has never happened blocks epic acceptance: the capstone is the integration-readiness gate, and an unexercised gate is the silent-skip failure mode this suite exists to prevent.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:384:## Architecture-Risk Tests\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:392:| Silent real-suite skip | TC-4.1's unkeyed leg asserts the not-ran record exists and is not a pass |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:409:- latest_self_note: \"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:457:    reviewScopeSummary: \"Initial verification for Story 5 covered AC-4.1, AC-4.2, TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3. I inspected the OpenRouter test host, suite accounting guard, keyed test wiring, shared seam helpers, lifecycle capstone wiring, package scripts, and relevant production inference paths; I ran the configured story and epic gates plus the focused unkeyed real-suite test.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:465:        evidence: \"The required keyed evidence was not established: the local environment has no LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY, `pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts` printed `NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)` and reported `4 passed | 9 skipped`, so the keyed TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 legs did not execute. The implementor artifact also records that the keyed local run and completion note are absent. The story DoD requires TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 green in a keyed local run and completion notes with date, model, and pass state; test-plan.md states an unexercised keyed run blocks acceptance.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:475:          - \"TC-4.1\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:476:          - \"TC-4.2\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:477:          - \"TC-4.3\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:486:        evidence: \"The required keyed evidence was not established: the local environment has no LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY, `pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts` printed `NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)` and reported `4 passed | 9 skipped`, so the keyed TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 legs did not execute. The implementor artifact also records that the keyed local run and completion note are absent. The story DoD requires TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 green in a keyed local run and completion notes with date, model, and pass state; test-plan.md states an unexercised keyed run blocks acceptance.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:496:          - \"TC-4.1\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:497:          - \"TC-4.2\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:498:          - \"TC-4.3\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:504:        - \"TC-4.1 unkeyed accounting: resolveRealSuiteEnv returns a not-ran record for absent or blank key; emitRealSuiteAccounting records one visible line; unkeyed focused suite output showed exactly one NOT-RAN line.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:506:        - \"TC-4.2 test wiring exists: runLifecycle accepts an InferenceConfig and inference-real.test.ts wires the real adapter into the Epic 04 lifecycle sequence when keyed.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:507:        - \"TC-4.3 test wiring exists: inference-real.test.ts invokes assertModelCallContract and assertRoutingThroughSdk against createOpenRouterCall when keyed.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:511:        - \"TC-4.3 keyed real-host conformance: the shared helper legs were skipped because LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY was unset.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:512:        - \"Definition of Done: no story completion note records keyed run date, model, and pass state.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:516:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:519:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:522:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:531:      - \"Provide a keyed run receipt for `cd packages/lhc && LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY=<key> pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts`, including date, model, and pass state, then rerun verification.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:533:      - \"Default CI posture is behaving as designed: the unkeyed suite reports NOT-RAN visibly and the story/epic gates passed without a network key.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:574:    planSummary: \"Implemented Chunk 5 (Story 5: Real-Inference Suite and Capstone). Added the test-owned OpenRouter ModelCall host (test/fixtures/openrouter-call.ts) implementing the AC-1.2 contract over plain fetch with the story's HTTP-status→failure-kind mapping (401/403→auth, 429→rate_limit, 400→invalid_request, network→network, other→other), resolveRealSuiteEnv key/model resolution (LHC_OPENROUTER_MODEL optional, fixture default openai/gpt-4o-mini), and a suite-level accounting emitter that writes exactly one visible RAN/NOT-RAN line. Parameterized the Epic 04 lifecycle fixture with an optional InferenceConfig so the capstone replays the identical sequence with the real adapter in the provider-arrival slot. Wrote test/inference-real.test.ts: four always-run accounting tests (unkeyed not-ran record with reason, shape distinguishable from a pass, whitespace-key leg, model defaulting, exactly-one-emission assertion) plus key-gated legs — TC-4.3 runs the unchanged assertModelCallContract/assertRoutingThroughSdk seam-conformance helpers against the real host, TC-4.1 asserts all seven kinds land ready with non-empty non-marker content and config-stamped openrouter provenance, TC-4.2 runs the full Epic 04 lifecycle (intake→drain→compact→pull→inspect→edit→rebuild→drain→compact→materialize) asserting every kind ready ≥ once, no deterministic marker anywhere (forms, both pulls, materialized file), real-model provenance, cleared-then-ready regeneration with content different from the pre-edit snapshot, checkpoint-coherent health (settled / cleared-set-pending-unclaimed / settled), and post-edit content in the second compact's view. CI default makes zero network calls; keyed legs report as skipped (never passes) with one NOT-RAN line. No package.json change needed: Story 1's verify rewrite already runs the env-gated suite in the default vitest tier.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:584:        reason: \"createLifecycleSdk/runLifecycle gain an optional InferenceConfig so the TC-4.2 capstone replays the exact Epic 04 sequence with the real adapter; deterministic default unchanged\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:587:        reason: \"New opt-in real-inference suite: TC-4.1 accounting + seven real round-trips, TC-4.2 lifecycle capstone structural assertions, TC-4.3 shared seam-conformance against the real host\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:603:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:606:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:609:        result: \"pass\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:611:      passesRun: 0\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:617:        - \"TC-4.2's regeneration assertion (post-rebuild content !== pre-edit content) is probabilistic against a real model in principle, but mutation-cleared forms re-derive from changed inputs, so collision is implausible; it is the spec's own assertion\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:620:      - \"DoD item 'keyed seven-kind real round-trip / capstone green in keyed local run, recorded with date, model, pass state' cannot be completed in this environment: LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY is not set and no key exists in the repo or shell profile. A human must run `cd packages/lhc && LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY=<key> pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-real.test.ts` once and record date, model (default openai/gpt-4o-mini unless LHC_OPENROUTER_MODEL set), and pass state in the story completion notes. Per the test plan this blocks epic acceptance, not the unkeyed story gate, which is green.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:622:      - \"Implementation target 'Verify accounting: packages/lhc/package.json scripts' required no change — Story 1's verify/verify-all rewrite already runs the env-gated suite inside the default vitest tier, and the suite self-reports its one ran/not-ran line there (observed in gate output: 'NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)').\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:623:    recommendedNextStep: \"Run story verification; in parallel, have the operator perform the one keyed local run with LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY and record date/model/pass-state in the completion notes to satisfy the remaining DoD line before epic acceptance.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:696:Latest note highlight: If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:700:- sequence=8; actionSequence=7; createdAt=2026-06-12T23:31:13.215Z; note=\"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:780:    selfNote: \"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:788:    note: \"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:893:Outcome: failed\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:920:{\"action\":\"run-self-review\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"artifactRefs\":[\"/abs/path.json\"],\"focus\":\"optional\",\"continuationRef\":\"storyImplementor\",\"passes\":1}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:925:{\"action\":\"accept-story\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"summary\":\"...\",\"acceptanceCheckRefs\":[\"...\"],\"acceptanceChecks\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"],\"reasoning\":\"...\"}],\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"accept\"},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"pass\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"...\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"]}]}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:941:Choose `accept-story` only when the latest verifier result is `pass`, no open findings remain, required proof is present, and the configured story gate passed.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:942:If readiness is promising but gate truth is failed, unavailable, or uncertain, do not accept. Choose the smallest safe next action: verify, quick-fix, block, or request a ruling.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:7:Do not invent tools, bypass the bounded action protocol, or rely on hidden provider session memory.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:45:- **AC-4.1**: The real-inference suite is opt-in on key presence and its outcome is always visible: ran (with the model assignments used) or not-ran (with reason) in the suite output. Absence of the key can never produce a silent pass. The suite's model-call function lives in test code, implements the AC-1.2 contract, and reaches a real endpoint.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:50:- **TC-4.1** (AC-4.1): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:54:  - the not-ran record is distinguishable from a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:56:- **TC-4.2** (AC-4.2): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:64:- **TC-4.3** (AC-1.2, AC-4.1): `inference-real.test.ts`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:83:- The not-ran path is as important as the keyed path because silent pass is the failure mode.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:109:- [test-plan.md §TC-4.1 / TC-4.2 / TC-4.3](/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/test-plan.md:91), lines 91-104\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:117:| TC-4.1 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | keyed seven-kind real round-trips; unkeyed not-ran record; exactly one suite-level ran/not-ran output line |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:118:| TC-4.2 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | Epic 04 lifecycle sequence under real adapter with structural checkpoint assertions |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:119:| TC-4.3 | `test/inference-real.test.ts` | OpenRouter host passes shared `ModelCall` contract and SDK routing helpers |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:121:#### Architecture-Risk Tests\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:125:| Silent real-suite skip | `test/inference-real.test.ts` unkeyed guard leg | Not-ran record has reason and cannot look like pass | A skipped keyed suite could leave default CI green without proving anything |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:126:| Fixture does not represent host boundary | `test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts` helpers | Same contract/routing helpers run against fake and real host functions | A direct OpenRouter call could pass while violating the SDK boundary shape |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:170:The CI-default suite makes zero network calls. The keyed run is recorded in story completion notes with date, model, and pass state.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:181:- Do not hide missing key with test skip semantics indistinguishable from pass.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:205:- Suite guard emits exactly one visible ran/not-ran record and unkeyed absence cannot look like a pass.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:206:- Keyed seven-kind real round-trip passes with non-empty, non-marker ready forms and real-model provenance.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:207:- Real-adapter lifecycle capstone passes structural checkpoint assertions.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:208:- TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 are green in the keyed local run; unkeyed not-ran accounting is green in default CI.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:209:- Story completion notes record keyed run date, model, and pass state.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:232:| `test/inference-real.test.ts` | opt-in (`LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY`) | TC-4.1, TC-4.2, TC-4.3 |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:245:- `hangingCall()` → `ModelCall` that never settles (timeout leg; tests pass a small `timeoutMs`).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:252:**`test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts`** (Chunk 0) — the parameterized contract assertions (DD-13): `assertModelCallContract(call)` (shape of success/failure results on a probe call) and `assertRoutingThroughSdk(call, assignments)` (TC-1.2's routing assertions extracted so TC-4.3 runs them against the real host unchanged).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:292:- exhaustion leg: all-whitespace script → form `failed`, reason `provider_failure`, last error names `empty_output`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:298:- `auth` → `failed` first attempt; scripted call shows exactly one invocation; stable reason\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:299:- `network` to exhaustion → `failed`, `provider_failure`, `metadata.lastError` preserved\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:307:### TC-4.1 — Real round-trips + accounting (AC-4.1)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:310:- unkeyed (controlled: suite re-invoked with key stripped from env in a subprocess-free way — the guard function called directly with empty env) → `notRan` record with reason; assert the record's shape and that it is not a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:313:### TC-4.2 — Capstone (AC-4.2)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:318:### TC-4.3 — Contract conformance, both hosts (AC-1.2, AC-4.1)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:363:| construction tests passing `floorTokens` | updated to two-field budgets; one new test: passing `floorTokens` is rejected as unknown config | config surface change |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:370:House pattern: Red = failing tests + skeleton stubs returning structured not-implemented failures; `red-verify` (build, typecheck, lint, boundaries — no behavior tests); Green = implementation until the chunk's tests pass; immutability check on test files after Green.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:379:| 5: Real suite | `inference-real` (guard testable unkeyed) | OpenRouter fixture, accounting guard, capstone leg | unkeyed: not-ran record asserted in CI; keyed: TC-4.1–4.3 green locally (run recorded in story DoD with model used) |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:382:**Story-completion accounting for Chunk 5:** the keyed run cannot gate CI (no secret in CI by design). The story's DoD requires a recorded keyed run — date, model, pass state — in the deviation/completion notes. A keyed run that has never happened blocks epic acceptance: the capstone is the integration-readiness gate, and an unexercised gate is the silent-skip failure mode this suite exists to prevent.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:384:## Architecture-Risk Tests\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:392:| Silent real-suite skip | TC-4.1's unkeyed leg asserts the not-ran record exists and is not a pass |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:461:Seeded first-turn instruction (not a prior runtime self-note): include `selfNote` when you want to leave a durable reminder for a later planner turn, for example `Track whether the next verifier pass still needs the ruling evidence.`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:528:Outcome: failed\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:555:{\"action\":\"run-self-review\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"artifactRefs\":[\"/abs/path.json\"],\"focus\":\"optional\",\"continuationRef\":\"storyImplementor\",\"passes\":1}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:560:{\"action\":\"accept-story\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"summary\":\"...\",\"acceptanceCheckRefs\":[\"...\"],\"acceptanceChecks\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"],\"reasoning\":\"...\"}],\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"accept\"},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"pass\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"...\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"]}]}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:576:Choose `accept-story` only when the latest verifier result is `pass`, no open findings remain, required proof is present, and the configured story gate passed.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:577:If readiness is promising but gate truth is failed, unavailable, or uncertain, do not accept. Choose the smallest safe next action: verify, quick-fix, block, or request a ruling.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:3:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-implement\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"No bounded child operation has run yet, and the story-local requirements are sufficient to start the implementation slice for the opt-in OpenRouter real-inference suite, visible ran/not-ran accounting, seam conformance checks, and lifecycle capstone.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"promptAddendum\\\":\\\"Implement Story 5 exactly from the provided story file and test plan. Focus on `test/fixtures/openrouter-call.ts`, shared seam conformance helpers as needed, `test/inference-real.test.ts`, and package script/accounting wiring. Preserve CI-default zero-network behavior, make the suite emit exactly one visible ran/not-ran record, and ensure unkeyed absence is asserted as a distinguishable not-ran record rather than a silent pass. Do not accept the story; return implementation evidence, commands run, and any keyed-run gap explicitly.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After implementation, verify whether keyed OpenRouter proof is present. If no keyed run evidence exists, do not recommend acceptance until that gap is resolved or ruled on.\\\"}\"}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:7:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Implementation is ready for verification, but acceptance requires an independent verifier pass and keyed OpenRouter proof is not present in the durable record.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/003-implementor.json\\\"],\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Verify Story 5 against TC-4.1, TC-4.2, and TC-4.3 using the story file and test plan only. Confirm the unkeyed not-ran accounting, suite-level exactly-one ran/not-ran output, zero-network default behavior, fixture contract/failure mapping, capstone structural assertions, and story gate evidence. Explicitly report whether keyed OpenRouter run evidence with date, model, and pass state exists; if absent, mark it as blocking acceptance rather than satisfied.\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"If verifier passes unkeyed/default behavior but keyed run evidence is still absent, do not accept; request ruling or block on the missing keyed proof required by the story DoD.\\\"}\"}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:11:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\